<title>UK: ICI prices 300 million stg 10-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>ICI prices 300 million stg 10-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers BZW and NatWest Markets said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ICI INVESTMENT NETHERLANDS BV</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  IMPERIAL CHEMICAL INDUSTRIES PLC</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN STG   COUPON     7.625     MATURITY    21.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.754   PAY DATE    21.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.154    SPREAD	+70 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.40	SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT GILT DUE 2007</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
